pansion is not ok IMO.\r\n> \r\n> > the spacer pushes the content outside the window when there isn't space, overflowing it.\r\n> \r\n> Based on the description, this is exactly what I was talking about, and I think this is the right way to address this issue. Could you please show a video demonstrating it in action to make sure we're talking about the same thing?\r\n> \r\n> P.S. To be clear, I like this PR and the feature in general, and all my comments here are aimed at improving it :)\r\n\r\nIt seems I had regressed the min-width code block without noticing, after reverting a test.\r\nRemoved it again on a1c6fda44af44e1f34e16a13cb0db631287613a1, and was able to add your recommendation ( caption buttons as overlay).\r\nNow the window size should be the same as default Godot. It still has a overflow issue, but so does the Godot build from the website.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4043142500/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4044871546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117086#issuecomment-4044871546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117086","id":4044871546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xF9d6","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/